  "rdfs:comment": {
    "de": [
      "Das Fremdenverkehrsamt informiert Sie, um den See von Annecy, seine kulturellen und patrimonialen Reichtümer, seine sportlichen Aktivitäten, seine Märkte... zu entdecken."
    ],
    "en": [
      "The Tourist Office offers the following services:\r\n- sale of books for hikes around Lake Annecy (IGN, walks around the lake ...),\r\n- sale of books and DVD featuring the history of the city and surrounding sites,\r\n- sales of Gourmet Map (1 meal purchased, one free meal in 25 participating restaurants)\r\n- sale of books bus network SIBRA,\r\n- ticket sales for tours of the old town.\r\nThroughout the year, many ticket shows, concerts ..."
    ],
    "it": [
      "L'Ufficio del Turismo vi informa sul lago di Annecy, sui suoi tesori culturali e patrimoniali, sulle attività sportive, sui mercati..."
    ],
